items.body:
Sandisk (NASDAQ:SNDK) has been the best-performing company in the S&amp;P 500 and Nasdaq 100 indices this year. It has soared by 800% since January, and is up by 4,755% in the last 12 months.&nbsp;



This surge has turned it from a small Western Digital (NASDAQ:WDC) spin-off into a $323 billion company. And in a recent note, a Bank of America analyst predicted that it has more upside to go.



Ba

